## Radix Sort Example

Input

```
319, 2122, 6, 8, 100, 50
```

Rewrite numbers with leading zeros

```
0319, 2122, 0006, 0008, 0100, 0050
```

Stable sort according to last digit (units place)

```
0100, 0050, 2122, 0006, 0008, 0319
```

Stable sort according to middle digit (tens place)

```
0100, 0006, 0008, 0319, 2122, 0050
```

Stable sort according to most significant digit

```
0006, 0008, 0050, 0100, 0319, 2122
```

Final sorted order

```
6, 8, 50, 100, 319, 2122
```

